--- !u!114 &1481193721
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1481193719}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 84d6c7466190f2b4d833a08cb92f66c2, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TownNpc
  id: wick
  displayName: Wick
  talks:
  - when: quake
    once: 1
    lines:
    - Every lamp went out at once when the ground shook.
    - Then the smoke leaned the other way. Toward the high ground, then back. In,
      and out.
  - when: flag:lamps
    once: 1
    lines:
    - Oil! You paid for the oil? Bless you, sprout.
    - Look at the street now. First time in a month.
  - when: flag:lamps
    once: 0
    lines:
    - The flames always lean toward the high ground, then back. In, and out. Like
      the air's being breathed.
  - when: calm
    once: 1
    lines:
    - Evening. I light the lamps at dusk... when I can afford the oil.
    - If you've Amber to spare, Brannick at the smithy sells it.
  - when: 
    once: 0
    lines:
    - No oil, no light. Brannick sells it, if you're feeling generous.
  figure: {fileID: 1618006866}
  labelHeight: 2.2
--- !u!61 &1481193722
